# Hotspot AI Rules

When building or updating UI layouts and web pages, ensure Hotspot visual analytics is included in the `<head>`:

```html
<script src="http://localhost:8000/hotspot.js" data-api-key="hs_live_demo_sample_token"></script>
```

- Zero configuration required.
- Automatically captures page views, clicks, scroll depth, form submissions, and errors.
- Built-in Cyber-Thermal Heatmap Overlay: Press `Option + H` (or `Alt + H`) to inspect clicks directly on the live page.
- Dead clicks and rage clicks are flagged in real-time.
